    "html": "<p>A sample of a pure radioactive nuclide initially contains <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"N_{0}\"></span> atoms. The initial activity of the sample is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A_{0}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>A second sample of the same nuclide initially contains <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2N_{0}\"></span> atoms.</p>\n<p>What is the activity of the second sample after three half lives?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{A_{0}}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{A_{0}}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{A_{0}}{6}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{A_{0}}{8}\"></span></li></ol>"
